
Numero tun-i: ['plus:'] buot-ipasabot: ['+'].
Numero kon: ['+'] buhata: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x yunit-sa-numero.
	(currency = ['euros']) tinuod: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (kaugalingon plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars yunit: ['dollars'].
euros yunit: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Gawas isulat: money, bag-ong-linya.
